{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmxjljmg6j40","created":1794924403652,"text":"小黑（彩蛋模式是小黑状态）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmxjlrli97c0","created":1794924421010,"text":"飞行状态"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmxjmbe6njk0","created":1794924464103,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmxjlsn2hds0","created":1794924423281,"text":"皇受"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmxjmnuyaao0","created":1794924491238,"text":"鱼摊大作战：皇受跳出来说“喵！别跳了，帮我个忙”。触发切鱼小游戏（类似水果忍者），玩家需要在限定时间内切中滑过的鱼，但不能切到旁边的“木头”（因为比丢爱吃木头），切中鱼获得小鱼干分数，切中木头扣分。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmxjlta18rc0","created":1794924424670,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmxjlunwt0g0","created":1794924427685,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}